# Environment for the Jellyfin client (/usr/local/bin/jellyfin).
# Set these to enable the Jellyfin now-playing panel; empty = off.
JELLYFIN_URL=""
JELLYFIN_KEY=""
# JELLYFIN_URL=http://mediaserver:8096
# JELLYFIN_KEY=<your-api-key-here>
#
# Use a USER access token, not an API key: an API key creates an anonymous
# Jellyfin session, and the server then refuses to store a playback position
# for it (the handheld still remembers its own). A user token can be minted
# without the password - see docs/desktop.md, "A user token for the client".
# Client transcode defaults (on): server-side 720p h264 for downloads of
# big/tall originals and for streaming. Opt out here if your server is slower
# than your network:
# JELLYFIN_DL_TRANSCODE=0
# JELLYFIN_STREAM_TRANSCODE=0
